xt": "The first organisms in a food chain are", "options": ["producers", "herbivores", "carnivores", "omnivores", "detritivores"], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 5", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-new-5-q43", "text": "(Graph) What conclusion can be drawn concerning the amount of CO₂ in the atmosphere?", "options": ["The atmospheric CO₂ started increasing in the year 1000, and it reached its peak in year 2000.", "The atmospheric CO₂ started increasing in the year in the 1000, and it reached its peak in year 1900.", "The atmospheric CO₂ started increasing in the year 1500, and it reached its peak in year 2000.", "The atmospheric CO₂ started increasing in the year 1700, and it reached its peak in year 2000.", "The atmospheric CO₂ started increasing in the year 1850, and it reached its peak in year 2000."], "answer": 4, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 5", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 450 180\" width=\"100%\" height=\"180\">\n  <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"45\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"230\" y=\"172\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Year</text>\n  <text x=\"-85\" y=\"16\" transform=\"rotate(-90)\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CO₂ (ppm)</text>\n\n  <text x=\"50\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1000</text>\n  <text x=\"140\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1400</text>\n  <text x=\"230\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1700</text>\n  <text x=\"310\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1850</text>\n  <text x=\"390\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2000</text>\n\n  <!-- Flat then hockey stick -->\n  <path d=\"M 50 135 L 310 132 Q 360 125 390 25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c62