 (-500 Gt)\"] --> P2[\"2000 to 2008:<br>Steady melt (-1000 Gt)\"]\n    P2 --> P3[\"2008 to 2016:<br>Steepest plunge (-1500 Gt drop)\"]\n    P3 --> Conclusion[\"Conclusion: Maximum amount of ice melting occurred 2008-2016\"]\n"}, {"id": "act-1-q1", "text": "Which are two organisms that compete on same food?", "options": ["Rabbit and fox", "Mouse and grasshopper.", "Hawk and snake.", "Owl and hawk"], "answer": 1, "answerUncertain": false, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT 1", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 750 600\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" style=\"background:#ffffff; font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n      <path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#374151\" />\n    </marker>\n    <filter id=\"shadow\" x=\"-10%\" y=\"-10%\" width=\"120%\" height=\"120%\">\n      <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"2\" stdDeviation=\"3\" flood-opacity=\"0.1\" />\n    </filter>\n  </defs>\n\n  <text x=\"375\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#111827\">Trophic Food Web (Question 1)</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"50\" y=\"510\" width=\"650\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcfce7\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\"/>\n  <text x=\"375\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">Grasses (Producers)</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"80\" y=\"380\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f3f4f6\" stroke=\"#4b5563\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\"/>\n  <text x=\"145\" y=\"408\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1f2937\">Rabbit</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"310\" y=\"380\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f3f4f6\" stroke=\"#4b5563\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\"/>\n  <text x=\"375\" y=\"408