ACT — Test 4", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "act-4-q18", "text": "Largemouth bass live on bluegills, and bluegills live on dragonfly larvae. Which of the following is the best explanation how removing of Dragonfly larvae could have indirectly cause the number of largemouth bass to decrease", "options": ["removing of largemouth bass's prey resulted in decrease the number of bluegills leaving less food for dragonfly larvae", "removing of bluegills' prey resulted in decrease the number of bluegills leaving less food for largemouth bass", "removing of large mouth's prey resulted in decrease the number of bluegills leaving less food for bluegills", "removing of dragonfly's larvae prey resulted in decrease the number of bluegills leaving less food for largemouth bass"], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT — Test 4", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "act-4-q23", "text": "Which of the following best describe the ecological community?", "options": ["a group of populations of different species that occupy the same geographical region", "a group of populations of same species that occupy the same geographical region", "biotic and abiotic factors that occupy the same geographical region", "only abiotic factors that occupy the same geographical region"], "answer": 0, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT — Test 4", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "act-4-q24", "text": "Which of the following statements is true about the percentage of energy from herbivore to lion?", "options": ["Tanya is true. About 10% of energy lost by respiration", "Tanya is true. About 90% of energy lost by respiration", "Jenny is true. About 50% of energy lost by faeces", "Jenny is true. About 90% of energy lost by faeces"], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT — Test 4", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "act-4-q28", "text": "Seven species of Anolis lizards successfully coexist in the same habitat. Which of the following statem