 adapt to the new seed size, because those changes are not passed on to their offspring.", "Some finches change their beak structure to adapt to the new seed size, and those changes are passed to their offspring.", "The finches having beak structure that allows them to more easily eat the new seed are quickly eliminated from the finch population.", "The finches having a beak structure that allow them to more easily eat the new seed are more likely to survive and have more offspring."], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT 2", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "act-3-q6", "text": "Which diagram represents Darwin theory of gradualism?", "options": ["A only.", "B only.", "Both of A and B.", "Neither A or B."], "answer": 0, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT 3", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 650 320\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\">\n  <style>\n    .axis { stroke: #000; stroke-width: 2.5; marker-end: url(#arrow); }\n    .tree-branch { fill: none; stroke: #2e7d32; stroke-width: 5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }\n    .axis-title { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; fill: #222; }\n    .title { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; text-anchor: middle; fill: #000; }\n  </style>\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n      <path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#000\"/>\n    </marker>\n  </defs>\n  <g transform=\"translate(30, 10)\">\n    <text x=\"140\" y=\"30\" class=\"title\">A</text>\n    <path d=\"M 40,270 L 40,35\" class=\"axis\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 40,270 L 260,270\" class=\"axis\"/>\n    <text x=\"-160\" y=\"25\" transform=\"rotate(-90)\" class=\"axis-title\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TIME</text>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"290\" class=\"axis-title\" text-anchor=\"middle\">MORPHOLOGY</