ant alle", "homozygous, because diseased individual must have two copies of mutant alle", "homozygous, because diseased individual must have one copy of mutant alle"], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT — Test 4", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "act-4-q22", "text": "Is a typical male can be heterozygous for a recessive sex-linked disease?", "options": ["no, to be heterozygous, you must have 2 copies of same allele and a male carry only one copy of X chromosome", "no, to be heterozygous, you must have 2 copies of different allele and a male carry only one copy of X chromosome", "yes, to be heterozygous, you must have 2 copies of different alleles and a male carry two copies of X chromosomes", "yes, to be heterozygous, you must have 2 copies of same allele and a male carry two copies of X chromosomes"], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT — Test 4", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "act-4-q29", "text": "What most probably the type of inheritance in the following pedigree?", "options": ["Autosomal recessive", "Autosomal dominant", "Sex inked recessive", "Sex linked dominant"], "answer": 0, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT — Test 4", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 220\" width=\"360\" height=\"220\" style=\"background:#fff; font-family:sans-serif;\">\n  <text x=\"180\" y=\"25\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">Pedigree Chart</text>\n  <rect x=\"70\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"65\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"147\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"147\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"65\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"65\" y1=