text-anchor=\"middle\">+ Pancreatic juice</text>\n    <text x=\"45\" y=\"195\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"8.5\" fill=\"#ea580c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fatty acids + glycerol</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n"}, {"id": "est-old-2-q77", "text": "How can you explain the plateau (constant) of oxygen consumption?\nI. Very high intensity exercise does not require increased amount of oxygen.\nII. Red blood cells are saturated with oxygen and can't bind more oxygen molecules.\nIII. The body uses CO2​ instead of O2​ when doing very high intensity exercises.", "options": ["I only", "II only", "III only", "I and II", "II and III"], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 2", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 320\" width=\"100%\" height=\"320\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"450,247 458,250 450,253\" fill=\"#000000\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"77,30 80,22 83,30\" fill=\"#000000\"/>\n  <g stroke=\"#e5e5e5\" stroke-width=\"0.8\">\n    <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"65\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"105\"/>\n    <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"145\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"185\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"185\"/>\n  </g>\n  <path d=\"M 85 240 L 140 215 L 200 180 L 260 145 L 320 115 L 370 115 L 420 115\" \n        fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <g fill=\"#2563eb\">\n    <circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"240\" r=\"3.5\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"215\" r=\"3.5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"180\" r=\"3.5\"/><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"145\" r=\"3.5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"115\" r=\"3.5\"/><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"115\" r=\"3.5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"420\" cy=\"115\" r=\"3.5\"/>\n  </g>\n  <line x1=\"320\" y1=\"11