oss the cell membrane faster than carbon dioxide.", "Oxygen diffuses across the cell membrane faster than carbon dioxide."], "answer": 4, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 3", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 460 300\" width=\"100%\" height=\"300\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"67,30 70,20 73,30\" fill=\"#000000\"/>\n  <g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">\n    <text x=\"63\" y=\"45\">200</text>\n    <text x=\"63\" y=\"95\">150</text>\n    <text x=\"63\" y=\"145\">100</text>\n    <text x=\"63\" y=\"195\">50</text>\n    <text x=\"63\" y=\"243\">0</text>\n  </g>\n  <g stroke=\"#e5e5e5\" stroke-width=\"0.8\">\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"42\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"42\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"92\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"142\"/>\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"192\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"192\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g fill=\"#1d4ed8\">\n    <rect x=\"95\"  y=\"196\" width=\"35\" height=\"44\"/>\n    <rect x=\"175\" y=\"60\"  width=\"35\" height=\"180\"/>\n    <rect x=\"255\" y=\"208\" width=\"35\" height=\"32\"/>\n    <rect x=\"335\" y=\"222\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\n    <text x=\"112\" y=\"258\">Carbon Dioxide</text>\n    <text x=\"192\" y=\"258\">Glucose</text>\n    <text x=\"272\" y=\"258\">Oxygen</text>\n    <text x=\"352\" y=\"258\">Water</text>\n    <text x=\"240\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\">Molecule</text>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"-135\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90)\">Size of molecule (a.u.)</text>\n</svg>\n"}, {"id": "est-old-3-q36", "text": "Which of the following is/are the function(s) of Smooth Endoplasmic Reticulum (SER)?\nI. Synthesis of protein\nII. Synthesis of lipids\nIII. Detoxification of the cell\nIV. Synthesis of ribosomes", "options": ["I only", "II only", "I and III", "II and III", "II, III, and IV"], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 3", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-3-q46", "text": "In eukaryotic cells, DNA is found in", "options": ["cytoplasm.", "ribosomes.", "the nucleus.", "the nucleus and ribosomes.", "the nucleus and cytoplasm."], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 3", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-3-q51", "text": "The following figure shows two media, A and B, containing water and solute. These two media are separated by a semi-permeable membrane. The particles of the solute are larger than the pores of this membrane.  What do you think will happen after few minutes?", "options": ["Medium A will have more solute particles since solute particles will move from medium B to medium A by diffusion.", "Medium A will have less solute particles since solute particles will move from medium A to medium B by diffusion.", "Medium B will have more water since water will move from medium A to medium B by osmosis.", "Medium A will have more water since water will move from medium B to medium A by osmosis.", "Nothing will happen, and the amount of water and solute in both media will stay the same."], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 3", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 280\" width=\"100%\" height=\"280\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <rect x=\"80\" y=\"40\" width=\"260\" height=\"180\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"81\" y=\"90\" width=\"129\" hei