ether.", "Before transcription, exons of mRNA are removed, and introns are joined together.", "After translation, introns of mRNA are removed, and exons are joined together."], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 2", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-new-4-q11", "text": "(Table) Which sequence(s) show(s) a substitution mutation?", "options": ["Sequence 2 only", "Sequence 3 only", "Sequence 4 only", "Sequences 2 and 3", "Sequences 3 and 4"], "answer": 0, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 4", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualMermaid": "graph TD\n    WT[\"Sequence 1 (Normal Baseline):<br>5'-ATG CCG TTA GAC TGA-3'\"]\n    \n    WT -->|Base substitution A->T at pos 11| S2[\"Sequence 2:<br>5'-ATG CCG TTA GTC TGA-3'<br>(Point mutation, no frameshift)\"]\n    WT -->|Base insertion +A at pos 10| S3[\"Sequence 3:<br>5'-ATG CCG TTA AGA CTG A-3'<br>(Frameshift & count change)\"]\n    WT -->|Base deletion -T at pos 13| S4[\"Sequence 4:<br>5'-ATG CCG TTA GAC GA-3'<br>(Frameshift & count change)\"]\n"}, {"id": "est-new-4-q12", "text": "(Table) Which sequence(s) show(s) a deletion mutation?", "options": ["Sequence 2 only", "Sequence 3 only", "Sequence 4 only", "Sequences 2 and 3", "Sequences 3 and 4"], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 4", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualMermaid": "graph TD\n    WT[\"Sequence 1 (Normal Baseline):<br>5'-ATG CCG TTA GAC TGA-3'\"]\n    \n    WT -->|Base substitution A->T at pos 11| S2[\"Sequence 2:<br>5'-ATG CCG TTA GTC TGA-3'<br>(Point mutation, no frameshift)\"]\n    WT -->|Base insertion +A at pos 10| S3[\"Sequence 3:<br>5'-ATG CCG TTA AGA CTG A-3'<br>(Frameshift & count change)\"]\n    WT -->|Base deletion -T at pos 13| S4[\"Sequence 4:<br>5'-ATG CCG TTA GAC GA-3'<br>(Frameshift & count change)\"]\n"}, {"id": "est-new-4-q13", "text": "(Table) Which sequence(s) show(s) an insertion mutation?", "options": ["Sequence 2 only", "Sequence 3 only", "Sequence 4 only", "Seque