entation is between 20∘C and 30∘C.", "The optimum temperature for yeast fermentation is between 10∘C and 20∘C."], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 3", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 320\" width=\"100%\" height=\"320\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <defs>\n    <pattern id=\"grid25\" width=\"80\" height=\"45\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <path d=\"M 80 0 L 0 0 0 45\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e5e5e5\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n    </pattern>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"80\" y=\"40\" width=\"340\" height=\"210\" fill=\"url(#grid25)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">\n    <text x=\"73\" y=\"45\">100</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"90\">75</text>\n    <text x=\"73\" y=\"135\">50</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"180\">25</text>\n    <text x=\"73\" y=\"253\">0</text>\n  </g>\n  <path d=\"M 80 250 C 130 250, 160 230, 200 130 C 230 75, 270 70, 310 75 C 330 80, 340 100, 345 220 C 348 240, 370 248, 410 248\" \n        fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/>\n  <g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\n    <text x=\"80\" y=\"268\">0</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"268\">10</text>\n    <text x=\"245\" y=\"268\">20</text><text x=\"325\" y=\"268\">30</text>\n    <text x=\"410\" y=\"268\">40</text>\n    <text x=\"250\" y=\"295\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\">Temperature (°C)</text>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"-145\" y=\"28\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90)\">Rate of Fermentation</text>\n</svg>\n"}, {"id": "est-old-4-q38", "text": "Choose the pair that correctly match.