 gland works only in its site.", "options": ["I only", "I and II", "II and III", "I, III and IV", "I, II and IV"], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 2", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 380\" width=\"100%\" height=\"380\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"720\" height=\"340\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"740\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"740\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"740\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"235\" x2=\"740\" y2=\"235\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"740\" y2=\"295\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"430\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"70\" y=\"47\">Lot of mice</text>\n    <text x=\"275\" y=\"47\">Experiment</text>\n    <text x=\"585\" y=\"47\">Result</text>\n  </g>\n  <g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\">\n    <text x=\"70\" y=\"94\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lot 1</text>\n    <text x=\"135\" y=\"94\">Mice with a normal pituitary gland</text>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"87\">Normal development of the ovaries and the</text>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"103\">uterus and a normal sexual cycle</text>\n\n    <text x=\"70\" y=\"140\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lot 2</text>\n    <text x=\"135\" y=\"135\">Ablation (removal) of the pituitary</text>\n    <text x=\"135\" y=\"151\">gland</text>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"135\">Decrease in the size of the ovaries and</text>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"151\">uterus and stop of the sexual cycle</text>\n\n    <text x=\"70\" y=\"198\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lot 3</text>\n    <text x=\"135\" y=\"188\">Ablation (removal) of the pituitary gland</text>\n    <text x=\"135\" y=\"204\">and injection of pituitary extracts</text>\n    <text x=\"135\" y=\"220\">(FSH and LH hormones)</text>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"196\">Normal development of the ovaries and</text>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"212\">uterus and a normal sexual cycle</text>\n\n    <text x=\"70\" y=\"262\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lot 4</text>\n    <text x=\"135\" y=\"257\">Ablation (removal) of the pituitary gland</text>\n    <text x=\"135\" y=\"273\">and grafting it in the abdomen</text>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"257\">Decrease in the size of the ovaries and</text>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"273\">uterus and stop of the sexual cycle</text>\n\n    <text x=\"70\" y=\"325\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lot 5</text>\n    <text x=\"135\" y=\"320\">Ablation (removal) of the pituitary gland</text>\n    <text x=\"135\" y=\"336\">and grafting it within its area</text>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"320\">Normal development of the ovaries and</text>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"336\">uterus and a normal sexual cycle</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n"}, {"id": "est-old-2-q45", "text": "The dorsal root of the spinal nerve reaching the leg of a frog is destroyed, then a thermal stimulation is done on the frog's leg.", "options": ["The frog will feel the stimulation and move its leg accordingly.", "The frog will not feel the stimulation, and it won't react to it.", "The frog will not feel the stimulation, and it will move its leg.", "The frog will feel the stimulation, but it will be paralyzed.", "The frog will feel and move its other leg accordingly."], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 2", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-2-q63", "text": "Based on concluding evidence from the above experiments, the sense organs that received the stimulus were", "options": ["the antennae.", "the legs.", "the wings.", "the eyes.", "the ears."], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 2", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 290\" width=\"100%\" height=\"290\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <rect x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"630\" height=\"240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"25\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"655\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"25\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"655\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"25\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"655\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"25\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"655\" y2=\"215\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"265\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"450\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"265\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"82\" y=\"49\">Experiment</text>\n    <text x=\"295\" y=\"49\">Experiment</text>\n    <text x=\"552\" y=\"49\">Result</text>\n  </g>\n  <g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\">\n    <text x=\"82\" y=\"93\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Experiment 1</text>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"85\">A cockroach was placed in a glass box with a</text>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"101\">speaker producing the voice of a toad.</text>\n    <text x=\"465\" y=\"85\">The cockroach didn't run</text>\n    <text x=\"465\" y=\"101\">away.</text>\n\n    <text x=\"82\" y=\"142\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Experiment 2</text>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"135\">A cockroach was placed alone in the glass box</text>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"151\">with air blowing on it.</text>\n    <text x=\"465\" y=\"142\">The cockroach ran away.</text>\n\n    <text x=\"82\" y=\"185\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Experiment 3</text>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"177\">The antennae of the cockroach were covered</text>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"193\">with petroleum based jelly, which acts as an</text>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"209\">insulator, then air is blown on the cockroach.</text>\n    <text x=\"465\" y=\"193\">The cockroach ran away.</text>\n\n    <text x=\"82\" y=\"238\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Experiment 4</text>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"233\">The legs of the cockroach were covered with</text>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"249\">petroleum based jelly, then air was blown on the</text>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"261\">cockroach.</text>\n    <text x=\"465\" y=\"238\">The cockroach didn't run</text>\n    <text x=\"465\" y=\"254\">away.</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n"}, {"id": "est-old-3-q6", "text": "In the framework of studying the role of parathyroid glands, two experiments were performed on a dog. The conditions and results of the experiments are represented in the table below.Which information can be revealed from the above experiments?", "options": ["Parathyroid glands secrete hormones that decrease the amount of calcium in blood.", "Parathyroid glands secrete hormones that increase the amount of calcium in blood.", "Parathyroid glands are exocrine glands that secrete hormones that decrease the amount of calcium in blood.", "Parathyroid glands are endocrine glands that secrete hormones that decrease the amount of calcium in blood.", "Parathyroid glands are exocrine glands that secrete hormones that increase the amount of calcium in blood."], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 3", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 220\" width=\"100%\" height=\"22