: "", "source": "EST Old 1", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": "Yes (Table)"}, {"id": "est-old-1-q55", "text": "Catalase is an enzyme that accelerates the chemical reaction of converting hydrogen peroxide into water and oxygen. The following graph shows the amount of released oxygen as a measure of the reaction rate relative to the concentration of catalase.What can you conclude concerning the relationship between the enzyme concentration and the rate of reaction?", "options": ["The rate of reaction increases when the concentration of the enzyme increases.", "The rate of reaction decreases when the concentration of the enzyme increases.", "The rate of reaction increases when the concentration of the enzyme decreases.", "The rate of reaction and the concentration of the enzyme are indirectly proportional.", "There is no relation between the rate of reaction and the concentration of the enzyme."], "answer": 0, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 1", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 460 330\" width=\"100%\" height=\"330\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <defs>\n    <pattern id=\"grid55\" width=\"40\" height=\"35\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <path d=\"M 40 0 L 0 0 0 35\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e0e0e0\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n    </pattern>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"80\" y=\"35\" width=\"320\" height=\"245\" fill=\"url(#grid55)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"425,277 433,280 425,283\" fill=\"#000000\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"77,20 80,12 83,20\" fill=\"#000000\"/>\n  <path d=\"M 80 280 L 145 220 L 225 155 L 305 95 L 385 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <g fill=\"#2563eb\">\n    <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"280\" r=\"3.5\"/><circle cx=\"145\" cy=\"220\" r