lants obtained have round peas and 118 have wrinkled peas. What conclusion can be drawn from this cross?", "options": ["Both parents are hybrid.", "Both parents are pure.", "The parent having round peas is hybrid.", "The parent having round peas is pure.", "The parent having wrinkled peas is hybrid."], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 1", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-1-q78", "text": "In order to study the effect of stress on the secretion of cortisol hormone, several experiments were done. Three lots of mice were subjected to different states of stress, whereby the level of stress that Lot 1 was subjected to was less than that of Lot 2, and that of Lot 2 was less than that of Lot 3. Then, the plasma concentration of Cortisol in these mice was measured; the results are shown in document 1.Moreover, the same experiment was performed on mice who were subjected to the ablation (removal) of their adrenal glands. The results of measurements revealed a very low concentration of plasma Cortisol in the three lots of mice.What conclusion can be derived from the above document?", "options": ["Adrenal glands secrete more Cortisol during stress.", "Adrenal glands secrete less Cortisol during stress.", "Cortisol secretion is not affected by stress.", "Absence of Adrenal glands increases Cortisol level.", "Absence of Adrenal glands does not affect Cortisol level."], "answer": 0, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 1", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 460 320\" width=\"100%\" height=\"320\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"77,30 80,20 83,30\" fill=\"#000000\"/>\n  <g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"