ualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-2-q49", "text": "A water plant placed under bright light gives off bubbles of oxygen. The table below shows the bubbles of oxygen produced per minute with respect to the distance of plant from light (cm).What conclusion can we draw from the given table?\nI. The amount of oxygen produced by the plant increases as the plant moves away from light.\nII. The amount of oxygen produced by the plant is not affected by the distance of the plant away from light.\nIII. The amount of oxygen produced by the plant decreases as the plant moves away from light.\nIV. The amount of oxygen bubbles produced when the plant is placed at a distance of 15 cm is less than 39 bubbles per minute.", "options": ["II only", "III only", "I and IV", "II and IV", "III and IV"], "answer": 4, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 2", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 230\" width=\"100%\" height=\"230\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <rect x=\"30\" y=\"25\" width=\"480\" height=\"180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"135\" y=\"49\">Distance from light (cm)</text>\n    <text x=\"375\" y=\"49\">Bubbles of oxygen produced per minute</text>\n  </g>\n  <g font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <tex