mosomes of 2 chromatids are produced.", "2 daughter cells having 4 chromosomes of 1 chromatid are produced.", "4 daughter cells having 2 chromosomes of 2 chromatids are produced.", "2 daughter cells having 2 chromosomes of 1 chromatid are produced.", "2 daughter cells having 8 chromosomes of 1 chromatid are produced."], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 2", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 320\" width=\"100%\" height=\"320\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"160\" r=\"120\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <g stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\">\n    <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"55\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#0f172a\"/>\n    <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"40\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"40\"/>\n    <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"35\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"265\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#0f172a\"/>\n    <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"265\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"280\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"265\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"265\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"285\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\">\n    <path d=\"M 180 55 Q 100 160, 180 265\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 180 55 Q 140 160, 180 265\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 180 55 Q 220 160, 180 265\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 180 55 Q 260 160, 180 265\"/>\n  </g>\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n  <g stroke=\"#0f172a\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n    <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"126\" y2=\"170\"/><line x1=\"126\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"170\"/>\n    <line x1=\"152\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"168\" y2=\"170\"/><line x1=\"168\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"152\" y2=\"170\"/>\n    <line x1=\"192\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"170\"/><line x1=\"208\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"192\" y2=\"170\"/>\n    <line x1=\"234\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"170\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"234\" y2=\"170\"/>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n"}, {"id": "est-old-2-q60", "text": "The heterotroph hypothesis states that", "options": ["the first cells on Earth were anaerobic heterotrophic prokaryotes.", "the first cells on Earth were aerobic heterotrophic prokaryotes.", "the first cells on Earth were anaerobic heterotrophic eukaryotes.", "the first cells on Earth were aerobic autotrophic prokaryotes.", "the first cells on Earth were aerobic autotrophic eukaryotes."], "answer": 0, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 2", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-2-q61", "text": "Which of the following mRNA strands is complementary to the given transcribed DNA strand?CCGATAGATCAAA transcribed DNA strand.", "options": ["CCGAUAGAUCAAA", "GGCUAUCUAGUUU", "GGCTATCTAGTTT", "GGCUAUCTAGTIUU", "GGCUAAGAAGUUU"], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 2", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-2-q62", "text": "The cockroach is an insect known for its rapid escape. In order to identify the stimulus that causes its escape and the sense organ that receives the stimulus; the following experiments were performed.Based on the above experiments, the stimulus that caused the cockroach to escape was", "options": ["seeing the predator.", "smelling the odor of the predator.", "feeling the air produced by the movement of the predator.", "hearing the voice of the predator.", "hearing the voice of the predator and feeling the air produced by the predator's movement."], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 2", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 290\" width=\"100%\" height=\"290\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <rect x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"630\" height=\"240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"25\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"655\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#334155\" str