 "A DNA nucleotide consists of", "options": ["phosphate group, deoxyribose sugar, and nitrogenous base (A, C, G or U).", "phosphate group, ribose sugar, and nitrogenous base (A, C, G or T).", "phosphate group, deoxyribose sugar, and nitrogenous base (A, T, G or U).", "phosphate group, deoxyribose sugar, and nitrogenous base (A, C, G or T).", "phosphate group, deoxyribose sugar, and nitrogenous base (T, C, G or U)."], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 5", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-5-q18", "text": "Inheritance of acquired traits", "options": ["Charles Darwin", "Lamarck", "Stephen J. Gould and Niles Eldridge", "Oparin and Haldane", "Hardy-Weinberg"], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 5", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-5-q19", "text": "Use and disuse", "options": ["Charles Darwin", "Lamarck", "Stephen J. Gould and Niles Eldridge", "Oparin and Haldane", "Hardy-Weinberg"], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 5", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-5-q20", "text": "Theory of punctuated equilibrium", "options": ["Charles Darwin", "Lamarck", "Stephen J. Gould and Niles Eldridge", "Oparin and Haldane", "Hardy-Weinberg"], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 5", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-5-q21", "text": "Populations tend to overpopulate", "options": ["Charles Darwin", "Lamarck", "Stephen J. Gould and Niles Eldridge", "Oparin and Haldane", "Hardy-Weinberg"], "answer": 0, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 5", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-5-q22", "text": "Hypothesized that under conditions that existed in early Earth, organic molecules could form", "options": ["Charles Darwin", "Lamarck", "Stephen J. Gould and Niles Eldridge", "Oparin and Haldane", "Hardy-Weinberg"], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 5", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-5-