, "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-5-q38", "text": "The meadow voles, grasshoppers, spiders, mice, and other organisms, along with the soil, minerals, and water make up a/an", "options": ["ecosystem.", "population.", "community.", "food chain.", "desert biome."], "answer": 0, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 5", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-old-5-q39", "text": "Which is correct about the data collected from June through August?", "options": ["Only the spider population has changed.", "The population of mice increased as the summer went on.", "The population of grasshoppers remained fairly constant.", "The population of birds remained fairly constant.", "Both the population of spiders and mice remained constant."], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "EST Old 5", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 220\" width=\"100%\" height=\"220\">\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n  <rect x=\"25\" y=\"20\" width=\"490\" height=\"175\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"25\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"25\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"25\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"25\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"25\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"175\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"290\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"400\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"350