/svg>"}, {"id": "est-new-1-q54", "text": "(Graph) Ribosomes are structures found in living cells... What conclusion can be derived from the above graph?", "options": ["The cell that has more ribosomes produces less protein.", "The cell that has more ribosomes produces more protein.", "The cell produces the same amount of protein, no matter what the number of ribosomes is.", "As the number of ribosomes doubles, the process of protein synthesis decreases by half.", "As protein synthesis increases, the number of ribosomes in the cell increases."], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 1", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 240\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px;height:auto;background:#F4F1E6;border-radius:4px;\">\n  <style>\n    .axis{stroke:#16232A;stroke-width:2px;}\n    .tick{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;fill:#16232A;text-anchor:middle;}\n    .axlbl{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;fill:#16232A;text-anchor:middle;}\n    .trend{stroke:#B0503A;stroke-width:2px;stroke-dasharray:5,3;}\n    .dot{fill:#B0503A;}\n  </style>\n\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"190\" class=\"axis\"/>\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"190\" class=\"axis\"/>\n  <text x=\"240\" y=\"222\" class=\"axlbl\">Number of ribosomes</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"105\" class=\"axlbl\" transform=\"rotate(-90 20 105)\">Total protein synthesis</text>\n\n  <text x=\"180\" y=\"205\" class=\"tick\">1 × 10⁵</text>\n  <text x=\"340\" y=\"205\" class=\"tick\">2 × 10⁵</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"35\" class=\"trend\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"dot\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"158\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"dot\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"142\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"dot\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"dot\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"108\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"dot\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"90\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"dot\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"dot\"/>\n</svg>"}, {"id": "est-new-1-q55", "text": "The adjacent diagram represents the nitrogen cycle. What conclusion can be drawn about the role of bacteria in the nitrogen cycle?", "options": ["Bacteria only fix nitrogen from the atmosphere.", "Bacteria play multiple roles in the nitrogen cycle, including nitrification and denitrification.", "Bacteria are only involved in decomposition.", "Bacteria are not involved in the nitrogen cycle.", "Bacteria convert nitrogen directly into proteins."], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 1", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 620 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;background:#F4F1E6;border-radius:4px;\">\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"narrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n      <path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#16232A\"/>\n    </marker>\n  </defs>\n  <style>\n    .box{fill:#F4F1E6;stroke:#16232A;stroke-width:2px;}\n    .lbl{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;fill:#16232A;text-anchor:middle;font-weight:600;}\n    .edge{stroke:#16232A;stroke-width:1.6px;fill:none;marker-end:url(#narrow);}\n    .elbl{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;fill:#2E5C43;text-anchor:middle;}\n  </style>\n\n  <!-- edges first -->\n  <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"130\" class=\"edge\"/>\n  <text x=\"215\" y=\"90\" class=\"elbl\">Nitrogen-fixing bacteria</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"430\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"150\" class=\"edge\"/>\n  <text x=\"345\" y=\"140\" class=\"elbl\">Decomposers</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"240\" class=\"edge\"/>\n  <text x=\"120\" y=\"205\" class=\"elbl\">Nitrifying bacteria</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"330\" class=\"edge\"/>\n  <text x=\"120\" y=\"310\"