ates. If a person eats only half of this meal, calculate the energy value obtained by this person.", "options": ["9 kcal", "16 kcal", "25 kcal", "45 kcal", "90 kcal"], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 1", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-new-1-q58", "text": "(Table) Based on the data provided, what conclusion can be drawn regarding the impact of cholesterol levels on the frequency of coronary heart disease?", "options": ["The frequency of coronary heart disease remains constant across all cholesterol levels.", "There is no increase in coronary heart disease frequency until cholesterol exceeds 250 mg/dL.", "Coronary heart disease frequency rises by approximately 1% with each 100 mg/dL increase in cholesterol levels.", "A cholesterol level of 220 mg/dL or higher is associated with at least a 5% risk of coronary heart disease.", "Individuals with cholesterol below 120 mg/dL have the highest risk of coronary heart disease."], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 1", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 260\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px;height:auto;background:#F4F1E6;border-radius:4px;\">\n  <style>\n    .axis{stroke:#16232A;stroke-width:2px;}\n    .tick{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;fill:#16232A;text-anchor:middle;}\n    .axlbl{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;fill:#16232A;text-anchor:middle;}\n    .val{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;fill:#F4F1E6;text-anchor:middle;}\n    .cat{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;fill:#16232A;text-anchor:middle;}\n  </style>\n\n  <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"210\" class=\"axis\"/>\n  <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"210\" class=\"axis\"/>\n  <text x=\"237\" y=\"245\" class=\"axlbl\">Blood cholesterol level</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"115\" class=\"axlbl\" transform=\"rotate(-90 20 115