ate level in the atmosphere will increase.", "The carbon monoxide level in the atmosphere will decrease."], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 3", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-new-3-q58", "text": "(Graph) Referring to the results of the above graph, what can you conclude concerning the variation of the concentration of CO₂ in the atmosphere?", "options": ["The concentration of CO₂ in the atmosphere has started to increase sharply since 1920.", "The concentration of CO₂ in the atmosphere has started to decrease sharply since 1940.", "The concentration of CO₂ in the atmosphere has started to increase sharply since 1970.", "The concentration of CO₂ in the atmosphere has started to decrease sharply since 1950.", "The concentration of CO₂ in the atmosphere has started to increase sharply since 1900."], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 3", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 450 180\" width=\"100%\" height=\"180\">\n  <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"220\" y=\"172\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Year</text>\n\n  <!-- Years -->\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1880</text>\n  <text x=\"160\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1920</text>\n  <text x=\"260\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1970</text>\n  <text x=\"360\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2000</text>\n\n  <!-- CO2 Line -->\n  <path d=\"M 60 135 L 260 115 Q 310 95 360 30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d32f2f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-dasharray=\"3\"/>\n  <text x=\"265\" y=\"45\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#d32f2f\">Sharp increase starts ~1970</text>\n</svg>\n"}, {"id": "est-new-3-q59", "text": "(Graph) Referring to the above graph, what can you conclude concerning the effect of CO₂ on global temperature?", "options": ["Low levels of CO₂ in the atmosphere have caused the global temperature to rise.", "Increasing levels of CO₂ in the atmosphere have caused the global temperature to rise.", "Increasing levels of CO₂ in the atmosphere have caused the global temperature to decrease.", "Increasing levels of CO₂ in the atmosphere have caused the global temperature to stabilize.", "The global temperature has not been affected by the concentration of CO₂ in the atmosphere."], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 3", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 450 180\" width=\"100%\" height=\"180\">\n  <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"220\" y=\"172\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Year</text>\n\n  <!-- Years -->\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1880</text>\n  <text x=\"160\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1920</text>\n  <text x=\"260\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1970</text>\n  <text x=\"360\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2000</text>\n\n  <!-- CO2 Line -->\n  <path d=\"M 60 135 L 260 115 Q 310 95 360 30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d32f2f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-dasharray=\"3\"/>\n  <text x=\"265\" y=\"45\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#d32f2f\">Sharp increase starts ~1970</text>\n</svg>\n"}, {"id": "est-new-3-q60", "text": "Mycorrhiza is the relation between green plants and fungi. Plants and fungi show better growth when they survive with each othe