m"], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 4", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-new-4-q7", "text": "Which system coordinates rapid communication between different parts of the body and regulates involuntary and voluntary actions?", "options": ["Reproductive system", "Endocrine system", "Nervous system", "Circulatory system"], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 4", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-new-4-q8", "text": "Which system produces hormones that help regulate processes such as metabolism, growth, and stress responses?", "options": ["Reproductive system", "Endocrine system", "Nervous system", "Circulatory system"], "answer": 1, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 4", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-new-4-q9", "text": "Which system is responsible for the production of gametes and hormones that regulate sexual development and function?", "options": ["Reproductive system", "Endocrine system", "Nervous system", "Circulatory system"], "answer": 0, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 4", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-new-4-q10", "text": "Which system includes the heart, blood vessels and blood?", "options": ["Reproductive system", "Endocrine system", "Nervous system", "Circulatory system"], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 4", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "est-new-4-q11", "text": "(Table) Which sequence(s) show(s) a substitution mutation?", "options": ["Sequence 2 only", "Sequence 3 only", "Sequence 4 only", "Sequences 2 and 3", "Sequences 3 and 4"], "answer": 0, "explanation": "", "source": "EST New 4", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualMermaid": "graph TD\n    WT[\"Sequence 1 (Normal Baseline):<br>5'-ATG CCG TTA GAC TGA-3'\"]\n    \n    WT -->|Base substitution A->T at pos 11| S2[\"Sequence 2:<br>5'-ATG CCG TTA GTC TGA-3'<br>(Point mutation, no frameshift)\"]\n    WT -->|Base insertion +A at pos 10| S3