 "text": "Molecule M is a carbohydrate composed of several hundred glucose units. What type of molecule is Molecule M?", "options": ["Disaccharide", "Monosaccharide", "Oligosaccharide", "Polysaccharide"], "answer": 3, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT 6", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "act-6-q29", "text": "Suppose a female bat has a total of 44 chromosomes in each of its diploid cells. How many individual chromosomes will most likely be in each of its gametes?", "options": ["88 chromosomes", "44 chromosomes", "22 chromosomes", "11 chromosomes"], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT 6", "hasVisual": false, "visualNote": null}, {"id": "act-6-q30", "text": "According to this diagram, which type of biome is most likely found in this region? (Avg temp 25°C, avg precip 285 cm)", "options": ["Temperate deciduous forest", "Temperate rain forest", "Tropical rain forest", "Tropical seasonal forest"], "answer": 2, "explanation": "", "source": "ACT 6", "hasVisual": true, "visualNote": null, "visualSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 650 520\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n  <rect width=\"650\" height=\"520\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/>\n  <g stroke=\"#E2E8F0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n    <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"390\" x2=\"570\" y2=\"390\"/>\n    <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"310\" x2=\"570\" y2=\"310\"/>\n    <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"570\" y2=\"230\"/>\n    <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"570\" y2=\"150\"/>\n    <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"570\" y2=\"70\"/>\n    <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"410\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"50\"/>\n    <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"410\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"50\"/>\n    <line x1=\"310\" y1=\"410\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"50\"/>\n    <line x1=\"400\" y1=\"410\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"50\"/>\n    <line x1=\"490\" y1=\"410\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"50\"/>\n  </g>\n  <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"410\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"410\" stroke=\"#2D3748\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"410\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#2D3748\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <text x